{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_sleach_set_2_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_sleach_set_2",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "鬓旁的花",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_sleach_2_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "0add5125af86c6497d067ba8547d4f166d01278958dd21816ce61d9ded9fe0e7",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "21_G3_victoria_street_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这么多人都来看我出旗吗？可千万不能出差错啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，得再确认一遍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "旗子崭新平整，没问题。服装整洁笔挺，没问题。还有佩剑和靴子......嗯，擦得很干净，也没有问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，对了，还有头发！还好还好，都没乱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚刚风吹得那么猛......昨天花了一整天来保养头发，在这地方掉链子不就什么都白费了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚驻军",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "升旗仪式现在开始，全体肃立！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚驻军",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出旗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "正步走过广场，她感受到众人的目光都集中在自己身上，于是将脊背挺得更加笔直。\n将旗帜挂在旗绳上，捏起旗子的一角，她开始等待讯号。\n三、二、一，鼓号声终于停息，她迅速将旗尾抛向空中，任它在晨风中舒展。随后，她听到脑后响起了久久不息的掌声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "深吸一口气，她将身体绷得更紧也更直，但嘴角却抑制不住地露出了笑意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "维尔，一共是七箱药品，都在这里了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "辛苦你跑这趟，简妮......可我们当时支付给商队的是二十箱的钱啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......商队里的人翻遍了货舱，只找出了这七箱，再没有更多的了。而且......剩余的钱他们也不想还给我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但价格不是我们一早就定好的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "商队来时因为穿越战区损失了很多货物，所以坚持要提高价格来弥补损失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可简妮，我们剩下的资金不多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本舰的补给还是没有到吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没......连消息都很久没收到了。简妮，你说，伦蒂尼姆那么动荡，本舰该不会......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "维尔，别胡思乱想，你也说了，时局不稳，兴许就是什么事耽搁了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那......接下来要怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咱们还是得把病患的需求放在首位，这七箱药有总比没有好，价格再高我们也只能认了。其他的......咱们能省就省吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一直省也不是办法啊......咱们地窖里就剩一点发芽的土豆了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "晚上回去我再想想有没有其他的办法，我和希拉女士约好的时间快到了，她家里的烟囱堵了，我得去看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，那我先回办事处了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_mini02_victoria_street_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的女人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "琴柳小姐，琴柳小姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希拉女士，你怎么追出来了？你的身体......我还是扶你回去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的女人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天风这么大，还是进屋子里来再坐坐吧。你刚从烟囱里爬出来就要离开，我都没来得及好好谢谢你呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没、没关系，我没法久留的，办事处还有病人呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的女人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最近天气冷，你和维尔的衣服够穿吗？我这里有几条裙子你们可以拿去穿，旧是旧了些，样式还是不错的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢你的好意了，希拉女士，瓦伊凡是没那么容易感冒的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的女人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，就算不为保暖也是可以穿穿的呀。你身上的衣服都补过好几回了，也没见你换过。你可不许走啊，我回屋给你拿......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真、真的不用！我马上就走了，女士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）爸爸，快看，那个姐姐的头发好漂亮啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清瘦的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）啧，每天还有闲情逸趣打理头发，真是个淑女小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "............"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清瘦的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，艾玛，快别看了，该走了，咱们和理发师约的时间快到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸爸，我们能不能不去啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清瘦的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "求你了，爸爸，我、我想像那个姐姐一样，不留那么长，就到肩膀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清瘦的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾玛，你怎么能像她一样！人家是大公司派来的人，不是来这里过苦日子的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清瘦的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咱们家呢，你妈妈病着，我得时时照顾，你要是留长发我哪有时间给你收拾？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......可是我......我、我真的不想剪寸头......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清瘦的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还不走！你想挨揍吗，艾玛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这位先生，有话好好和孩子说，为什么要动手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清瘦的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......那个......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不住地啜泣）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清瘦的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......孩子调皮，我小小教训下，就......小小教训下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清瘦的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打扰女士您做事了，真不该......不好意思，不好意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清瘦的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了好了，艾玛，赶紧走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的女人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "琴柳小姐，我还以为你已经走了呢。这是衣服，还有我家里剩下的一小袋面粉，都给你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这不好吧......希拉女士，你食物足够吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的女人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "够，当然够，我男人在前线吃军饷，家里就我一个人吃饭，肯定够，你就放心吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......谢谢、谢谢你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "21_G3_victoria_street_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚驻军",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "简妮，你在这里待多久了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "报告长官，两、两三个小时？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚驻军",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎么来这么早？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天是我第一次在广场上升旗，心里很激动，昨天一晚上都没睡着，干脆早早就来这里等着了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚驻军",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？你这副模样可不像一晚上都没睡啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......等天亮的时间里，总归还是要找些事情做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚驻军",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，做得不错，看着是挺光彩照人的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢您的夸奖，长官。注意仪容仪表，本就是仪仗兵该做的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚驻军",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行了行了，仪仗兵女士，太阳要升起来了，去把旗子也升起来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遵、遵命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "简妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "将被晨风吹乱的发丝拢至耳后，女孩站起身来，举起旗帜向广场中央的旗杆走去。\n随着旗帜缓缓升起，早早等候在广场上的民众开始热烈地鼓掌。\n掌声里，几声低语飘进了女孩的耳中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是不明白，小丘郡这种镇子也需要派个专门的仪仗兵来升旗吗？好像这事我们没法办似的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵，我可不会为了看大老爷们升旗早早从床上爬起来。至少这场面挺赏心悦目的，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要我说，不如送几沓电影海报来，人手一张，每天挂在墙上欣赏，特别振奋人心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "闭嘴吧，别嚷嚷了，就是个仪仗兵，赏心悦目就够了，你要求那么多干什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "将目光投向人群，女孩试图从中分辨出讲话的人。\n但所有人的脸上都洋溢着赞许的笑容，女孩怀疑刚刚的声音只是幻听。\n凛冽的晨风突然朝广场吹来，倒灌进女孩的领口。\n在风中，女孩忍不住打了一个哆嗦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g8_srcroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "起床了！简妮，起床了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "几点了......维尔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "才五点，咱们六点出门，你还有时间梳个辫子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了......今天不梳了，我们直接走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个......维尔，你知道镇子上的理发师住在哪里吗？我打算去剪个头发。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什、什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要......要是没有的话，我自己剪也可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不、不是......镇子上当然有理发师，就住在街尾最后一家。但简妮......这么好的头发，剪掉多可惜啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "留着难免妨碍到工作嘛......那明天下午你可以帮我顶个班吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎、怎么这么着急？要不再等等？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是不想我剪短吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有的事啦，剪短就剪短嘛......干活更利索，况且你短头发肯定也好看的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......谢谢你，维尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor_u"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打扰了，请问现在在营业时间吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理发师",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "琴柳小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生您认识我吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理发师",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这镇子上谁不知道您呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理发师",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您今天怎么过来了，要保养头发吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不、不是的，我是来剪头发的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理发师",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剪头发啊......那坐吧，琴柳小姐，我去拿剪刀。如果您想喝点水，桌上就有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "麻烦了，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理发师",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您打算剪多短呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剪得和大家差不多就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理发师",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那......我剪了，琴柳小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "镜子里，理发师捉起了女孩的一撮发丝夹在指缝中，刀锋相合，发丝便从他手中掉落。\n女孩盯着那束落在地上的发丝，放空了思绪，等待着耳边的剪刀再响第二声。\n她等了一会儿，没有等到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理发师",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您怎么不剪了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理发师",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "琴柳小姐，我们的消息没有你们那么灵通，你们来自大公司，能接触到的渠道比我们这样的平头百姓要多。我想问......想问......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没事的，先生，如果您需要帮忙，我肯定会帮您的。您是要打听什么事吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理发师",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是......不、不是的，我就想问问镇子的情况，你们是不是看到了些不好的势头？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您怎么会这么想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理发师",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您说呢，琴柳小姐？您都来剪头发了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剪、剪个头发而已，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理发师",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "琴柳小姐，您不是一直都是这个形象吗？怎么现在突然就要剪短了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是现在精力和时间都有限，我、我顾不上这些了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理发师",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......有事要发生了，对吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我没有收到那样的消息，目前来说......一切都好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理发师",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......您骗我，琴柳小姐，您就直说吧，是不是那些萨卡兹马上就要打过来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理发师",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您是不是觉得大家承受不了真相，所以瞒着大家，不愿意说？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没向大家隐瞒任何事情，先生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理发师",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那......如果事态没有变坏，您为什么要剪头发？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生......别这么激动，冷、冷静些好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理发师",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您今天突然找上我，让我剪掉您的头发，还要求越短越好，就好像下辈子都不打算在头发上花心思了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理发师",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前再难的时候，您、您也没说要剪头发啊，怎么今天就要剪了呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......先生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理发师",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想我还是抽时间改天再来吧，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_mini02_victoria_street_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希拉女士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的女人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "琴柳小姐？你怎么在这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没什么，我来就是想剪个头发，最近工作忙，抽不出时间打理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸......希拉女士，你今天是涂了口红吗？怪不得看着气色好多了，这颜色挺适合你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的女人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "听到琴柳的夸赞，女人却并没有露出喜色，反而仓皇地用手蹭去了唇上的绯红。\n随后她又捏起衣角，擦拭起手背上残留的颜色。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "女人的力气很大，手背上的皮肤都被擦红了，也没能将上面的颜色擦拭干净。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希拉女士，你、你这是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的女人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也是我糊涂，都什么时候了，怎么还把那支口红拿出来涂，连琴柳小姐你这样体面过日子的人都没心思了......唉，真不该。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的女人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个......琴柳小姐，你赶紧去忙吧，我、我先回去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希拉女士......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g8_srcroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？简妮，你没有剪头发吗？我还在期待你的新发型呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我和理发师重新约了时间，过几天再去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幸好你没有剪，不然就没法戴这个了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "纸花？你折的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我哪有那么巧的手，是一个小女孩送来的，说希望你能喜欢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真漂亮，用软绵绵的餐巾纸折花，真是难为她了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不戴上试试吗？配你的长发应该很适合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......之后就要剪掉了......这不是浪费人家的心意吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那不是几天后的事情吗？不耽误现在，戴上嘛......你就戴上试试嘛，你看这花折得多好，就像真花一样漂亮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "将那朵纸花凑到鼻尖轻轻嗅闻，女孩的眼神中露出了一丝陶醉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......我好像能从上面闻到鲜花的香味......淡淡的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "维尔......那不是真的花，再像也不是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道的嘛，可快到冬天了，离春天又还远，现在也没有真的花啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赏花留到春天再做也可以啊，冬天有冬天要做的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我们在冬天做了那么一大堆事，不都是为了等待下个春天的到来嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在一个漫长的冬天里，就算只是朵小小的纸花，也能提醒大家春天会如约而至。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果没有那朵纸花呢......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也不知道啊，简妮......纸花就是个盼头，无论大家有没有盼头，春天都会来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，维尔，人们期盼一样东西，不仅是想让它来到自己身边，更是想让它来到自己心里吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或许一个人不会永远活在冬天，但一个人的心会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是......没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......把那朵花给我吧......维尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦......好、好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "摸了摸纸花柔软的花瓣，琴柳用指尖捏住纸花，转了几圈，然后戴在了耳边，又似乎是因为羞涩，轻轻低下头。\n无言半晌，最终她抬起头，看向同事的眼睛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你觉得怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......冷死了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "琴柳小姐，早、早上好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "早、早上好，小妹妹你......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你头上的花是我昨天折的......你今天戴着，我、我特别高兴......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......噢，这朵花是你送的吗？谢谢，折得很漂亮，我很喜欢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就太好啦......琴柳小姐，我、我能摸摸你的头发吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然、当然可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的头发真的好漂亮啊，妈妈以前也和你一样，头发长长的，可生病后就剪掉了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等她病好了，一定还会把头发再留起来的，到时候一定会比我的头发还漂亮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，那也是很远很远以后的事情了，妈妈的病......一直都不见好......爸爸最近很难过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别担心，说不定到明年开春就能有起色了。到时候，你可以带着她去公园里折些真正的花，配她的长发一定很适合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人的头发哪里会长那么快啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没关系，到时候我和你们一起去，我可以把头发借给她......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "借？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "琴柳撩起自己的长发，披在女孩的脑袋上，浓密的金色发丝将女孩整个人都包裹在里面。\n而那束在女孩手里的发丝被她攥紧，复又松开。\n意识到女孩在紧张，琴柳将纸花从鬓边摘下，戴在了女孩的耳旁。\n一瞬间，女孩的脸涨红了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好、好看吗，琴柳小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好看，非常好看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理发师",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾玛，我给你爸爸剪完了，到你来剪了......欸，琴柳小姐......你们？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清瘦的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎......爸爸，你来啦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "看到父亲从门后出现，女孩慌张地将琴柳的头发从脑袋上拨开，而那朵挂在她耳朵上的白花也被她急匆匆的动作扫落在地。\n但出乎意料的是，她的父亲只是轻轻摸了摸她的脸颊，然后将花捡起，塞回了她的手心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清瘦的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等久了吧，冷不冷？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不久，也不冷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "早上好，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清瘦的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "早上好，琴柳小姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理发师",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个......琴柳小姐......我这几天暂时还没有时间，您剪头发的事......可能还要再等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，琴柳小姐......你、你要剪头发吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理发师",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您不剪了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对，我改主意了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理发师",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那艾玛呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸爸......我、我能不剪吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清瘦的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一阵风从长街穿过，琴柳将被吹乱的发丝拨回耳后，看向了男人。\n女孩攥紧了手里的纸花，理发师用脚尖蹭了蹭门框。\n在所有人期待的目光中，男人喉头一动，终于张口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
